[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0010","text":"好耶～！\n圆香前辈请客～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0020","text":"请"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0030","text":"雏菜要长崎蛋糕哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0040","text":"那浅仓就这个"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0050","text":"哦—，御手洗团子\n谢啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0060","text":"……好、好久没这样了\n大家一起回家……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0070","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0080","text":"飞机好近啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0090","text":"真的呢～\n那孩子会不会在上面呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0100","text":"跟它拜拜吧～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0110","text":"那孩子是？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0120","text":"大概，是说那个留学生吧……？\n在雏菜同学家寄宿过的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0130","text":"啊\n那个留学生，交给雏菜没问题吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0140","text":"什么嘛，你那口气～！\n雏菜可是教了她好多好幸福～的事哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0150","text":"她也教了雏菜好多东西，\n超开心的～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0160","text":"这、这样啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0170","text":"……雏、雏菜同学也会想去国外什么的……\n对那种事有兴趣吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0180","text":"诶～？\n留学生过来和雏菜去国外，又没什么关系～\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0190","text":"而且雏菜，\n现在在noctchill待着最开心了～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01060200_08_0200","text":"……！\n对、对哦……！"}]
